{"id":1585,"title":"非线性数据结构","summary":"导言","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3801ee19-f02c-3264-91f3-a1ecb93afa32","knowledge_id":652,"title":"导言","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":652,"title":"导言","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e9f87535-d245-3b69-9fb2-e356ff858a12","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在此之前，我们已经学习的数据结构--Python列表、链表、栈、队列--它们都是**线性数据结构**。\n\n在线性数据结构中，可以：\n\n- 元素按顺序排列。\n- 除了第一个和最后一个元素外，每个元素都有上一个和下一个元素。\n- 元素可在一个for中全部遍历。\n\n线性数据结构功能强大，用途广泛。不过，它们也有一定的局限性，我们将在下文中探讨。","text_html":"<p>在此之前，我们已经学习的数据结构--Python列表、链表、栈、队列--它们都是<strong>线性数据结构</strong>。</p>\n<p>在线性数据结构中，可以：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>元素按顺序排列。</li>\n<li>除了第一个和最后一个元素外，每个元素都有上一个和下一个元素。</li>\n<li>元素可在一个for中全部遍历。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>线性数据结构功能强大，用途广泛。不过，它们也有一定的局限性，我们将在下文中探讨。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"17101fbc-b1f7-36fb-b043-023b0ee20982","knowledge_id":653,"title":"现实生活例子：规划旅行路线","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":653,"title":"现实生活例子：规划旅行路线","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0e060409-c1b2-3113-99d4-78edea18dbc6","title":"","title_html":"","text":"假设你要从**A**市前往**F**市。","text_html":"<p>假设你要从<strong>A</strong>市前往<strong>F</strong>市。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"68c2ae1d-585c-35d5-8d45-a32e169e571f","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/81ca7fe6676599655d50.png","style":"original","caption":"A Linear Path","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":630,"size_in_bytes":40096,"name":"dsa-10.1.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"10ac83c9-1fe3-3221-9f92-e435e33f3a46","title":"","title_html":"","text":"这是一个非常适合线性数据结构的问题，因为每个城市都有一个唯一的**前置**和**后续**地标。\n\n然而，在现实生活中，从**A**到**F**可能有这样多条路径。","text_html":"<p>这是一个非常适合线性数据结构的问题，因为每个城市都有一个唯一的<strong>前置</strong>和<strong>后续</strong>地标。</p>\n<p>然而，在现实生活中，从<strong>A</strong>到<strong>F</strong>可能有这样多条路径。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"93fe1d24-cf36-35a3-bbe3-e21ad7fe9c0c","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/b5e615a5c7302b40bffc.png","style":"original","caption":"Path with Branches","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":630,"size_in_bytes":45150,"name":"dsa-10.1.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"d188dcaa-ca23-35f1-9f4f-91b4d6db2655","title":"","title_html":"","text":"如果我们采用线性数据结构来解决这个非线性问题，解法可能不是最优的，接下来我们将探讨这个问题。","text_html":"<p>如果我们采用线性数据结构来解决这个非线性问题，解法可能不是最优的，接下来我们将探讨这个问题。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6e1b17d6-3fb7-3f92-a0d8-1af9689f53bd","knowledge_id":654,"title":"用线性结构解决问题","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":654,"title":"用线性结构解决问题","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5020ab44-d6ae-3f94-9e62-f67c0e553b19","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在线性结构中，每个元素都必须有**唯一**的前一个元素和后一个元素。然而，目前的问题在城市**B**处出现了一条分支路径。\n\n为了保持线性，我们将选择最近的地标城市**C**作为城市**B**的下一个城市。","text_html":"<p>在线性结构中，每个元素都必须有<strong>唯一</strong>的前一个元素和后一个元素。然而，目前的问题在城市<strong>B</strong>处出现了一条分支路径。</p>\n<p>为了保持线性，我们将选择最近的地标城市<strong>C</strong>作为城市<strong>B</strong>的下一个城市。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5c1f1506-9f12-3984-a3c4-c1251c9f19cf","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/6bc9255819247de740bd.png","style":"original","caption":"Path Taken in Linear Approach","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":630,"size_in_bytes":57468,"name":"dsa-10.1.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e3ce5811-97a7-3b2c-b569-ff557636dc06","title":"","title_html":"","text":"根据这一逻辑，我们的路线是**a** -> **b** -> **c** -> **d** -> **e** -> **f**。\n\n这里，总路程为**13 km（2+4+4+1+2）**。","text_html":"<p>根据这一逻辑，我们的路线是<strong>a</strong> -&gt; <strong>b</strong> -&gt; <strong>c</strong> -&gt; <strong>d</strong> -&gt; <strong>e</strong> -&gt; <strong>f</strong>。</p>\n<p>这里，总路程为<strong>13 km（2+4+4+1+2）</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b7178c36-80f4-30f2-ac28-46986dd12174","knowledge_id":655,"title":"用非线性方法解决问题","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":655,"title":"用非线性方法解决问题","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fc669be2-fe7f-340e-a0b3-ff33c318dca2","title":"","title_html":"","text":"在非线性方法中，一个元素可以有任意数量的上一个元素和下一个元素。在这里，我们列出所有可能的路径，并选择最佳路径。","text_html":"<p>在非线性方法中，一个元素可以有任意数量的上一个元素和下一个元素。在这里，我们列出所有可能的路径，并选择最佳路径。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"92f34cb9-eaef-366f-a8c9-fd0dc5fe2809","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/1d5addc9b878b49c0444.png","style":"original","caption":"Multiple Paths in Non-Linear","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":556,"size_in_bytes":68935,"name":"dsa-10.1.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8e15c72c-d838-3793-bfd2-05bc1c5eb3e1","title":"","title_html":"","text":"从这幅图中我们可以看出，从**A**到**F**有多种到达方式。\n\n- **路径 1**：**A** -> **B** -> **C** -> **D** -> **E** -> **F; 13 km**\n- **路径 2**：**A -> B-> E -> F；10 km**\n\n由于 **路径 2** 提供了从 **A** 到 **F** 的最短路径，因此选择 **路径 2**。","text_html":"<p>从这幅图中我们可以看出，从<strong>A</strong>到<strong>F</strong>有多种到达方式。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>路径 1</strong>：<strong>A</strong> -&gt; <strong>B</strong> -&gt; <strong>C</strong> -&gt; <strong>D</strong> -&gt; <strong>E</strong> -&gt; <strong>F; 13 km</strong></li>\n<li><strong>路径 2</strong>：<strong>A -&gt; B-&gt; E -&gt; F；10 km</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>由于 <strong>路径 2</strong> 提供了从 <strong>A</strong> 到 <strong>F</strong> 的最短路径，因此选择 <strong>路径 2</strong>。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"50f064cf-756c-345f-aeae-047b0e16cc45","knowledge_id":656,"title":"为什么采用非线性方法？","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":656,"title":"为什么采用非线性方法？","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ecd2a24f-9188-35f5-9c02-0aecc062d338","title":"","title_html":"","text":"从上一个问题中，我们了解到，当问题的特征是一对一关系时，线性方法和线性数据结构都非常有效。\n\n然而，当元素之间存在一对多关系时，线性方法和线性数据结构可能无法提供最佳解决方案。\n\n让我们继续来看另一个例子，充分了解线性数据结构的局限性。\n\n假设有一家三口进入一个房间。**Max**是**Alice**和**Bob**的父母。\n\n我们可以使用列表来存储他们的姓名，如下所示：","text_html":"<p>从上一个问题中，我们了解到，当问题的特征是一对一关系时，线性方法和线性数据结构都非常有效。</p>\n<p>然而，当元素之间存在一对多关系时，线性方法和线性数据结构可能无法提供最佳解决方案。</p>\n<p>让我们继续来看另一个例子，充分了解线性数据结构的局限性。</p>\n<p>假设有一家三口进入一个房间。<strong>Max</strong>是<strong>Alice</strong>和<strong>Bob</strong>的父母。</p>\n<p>我们可以使用列表来存储他们的姓名，如下所示：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7eb9cbb1-34a1-313b-b5f7-596379a44ff6","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/50a747f64346cc151c52.png","style":"original","caption":"Using List to Represent Data","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":314,"size_in_bytes":7388,"name":"dsa-10.1.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6b65cc28-f039-39c2-abfa-e987c2845f0a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"你能用线性数据结构来显示它们之间的关系吗？\n\n由于我们的示例包括一个父代有两个子代（一对多），因此不能使用线性数据结构来显示这些信息。","text_html":"<p>你能用线性数据结构来显示它们之间的关系吗？</p>\n<p>由于我们的示例包括一个父代有两个子代（一对多），因此不能使用线性数据结构来显示这些信息。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"dd57ec54-16e5-3e2b-855b-70ca534a70f9","text":"线性数据结构的主要限制在于，它们不能自然地表示层次或分支关系，因为每个元素都只能有一个前置元素和一个后继元素。","text_html":"<p>线性数据结构的主要限制在于，它们不能自然地表示层次或分支关系，因为每个元素都只能有一个前置元素和一个后继元素。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8aab71d2-5eb3-3c1c-8c0c-3b532a874449","title":"","title_html":"","text":"那么，我们用下图方法来表示这种层级关系如何？","text_html":"<p>那么，我们用下图方法来表示这种层级关系如何？</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"be2f8af3-921a-382a-a88f-1c74754c9608","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/b6440106a5754e352fbf.png","style":"original","caption":"Using Tree to Show Relationship Between Elements","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":478,"size_in_bytes":16409,"name":"dsa-10.1.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ea80ea4d-79b0-352d-a0f4-19374992b3cf","title":"","title_html":"","text":"从图中可以看出，**Max** 是**Bob** 和 **Alice**的父母。\n\n这个图叫做**树**，是下一节开始要学习的第一个重要非线性数据结构。","text_html":"<p>从图中可以看出，<strong>Max</strong> 是<strong>Bob</strong> 和 <strong>Alice</strong>的父母。</p>\n<p>这个图叫做<strong>树</strong>，是下一节开始要学习的第一个重要非线性数据结构。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6}]}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1585"}
